{"3995840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FerryMan", "steam_appid": 3995840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/185ba93b4fec756c8e8bcf27e22308dd.avif?t=1786135025\" width=616 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/28ca7944068b6c7c13f7db8e9cf974eb.poster.avif?t=1786135025\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/28ca7944068b6c7c13f7db8e9cf974eb.webm?t=1786135025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/28ca7944068b6c7c13f7db8e9cf974eb.mp4?t=1786135025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are not a servant anymore.</strong><br><br><strong>On a boat drifting down the River of Blood, you revolt against death itself. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every card you play is a gamble. Every roll can either save you… or end you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/874a7932651f421a0f52ec3c3e3570a9.avif?t=1786135025\" width=616 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/6c2710a02f73dbf9d0a4097df86fd9b9.poster.avif?t=1786135025\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/6c2710a02f73dbf9d0a4097df86fd9b9.webm?t=1786135025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/6c2710a02f73dbf9d0a4097df86fd9b9.mp4?t=1786135025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your only ally?</strong><br><strong> A small crow who drops strange Sacrifices that bends luck in your favor, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>and also reacts to your moves.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/dad3ee1fc6d477edffb008abc396a987.avif?t=1786135025\" width=616 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/62fb6a0e5e2dcaeb2df3dfbd2a3cb46a.poster.avif?t=1786135025\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/62fb6a0e5e2dcaeb2df3dfbd2a3cb46a.webm?t=1786135025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/62fb6a0e5e2dcaeb2df3dfbd2a3cb46a.mp4?t=1786135025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use Sacrifices to change probability.</strong><br><strong> Push low rolls higher. Or risk it all with normal dice rolls and </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>earn powerful boons through your crow.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/b052211d10f213ce6403d7d716e1f4d2.avif?t=1786135025\" width=616 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/d28e60046d17a13d0ed0fd638c27bdea.poster.avif?t=1786135025\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/d28e60046d17a13d0ed0fd638c27bdea.webm?t=1786135025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/d28e60046d17a13d0ed0fd638c27bdea.mp4?t=1786135025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Navigate the River between battles.</strong><br><strong> Choose encounters, crow upgrades, rest stops, or boss fights  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>then return to the river and chart your next move.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995840/extras/d66e578eb255785d1f129c144787db11.avif?t=1786135025\" width=616 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Battle Powerful Bosses -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Build and Customize Your Deck -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Explore the River Map, Packed with Strong Encounters -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Upgrade Your Crow to Unloc